whoami - tells you who you are on the system
echo - output the specific text that is provided
ls - list the files inside the folder 
cd - change directory, moves into the folder
cat - displays the content of the file
pwd - present working directory, tells you where are you currently
find - search for files by name
grep - search for texts inside a file
& - runs the command and does not wait for it to complete for you to do anything else
&& - runs both the commands and wait for the first command to finish first
> - redirect command output to a file, this overwrites the content in the file
>> - redirects the output as well but does not overwrites it, the content will be added to the bottom of the file
